        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Project MT</strong> is a <strong>fast-paced 2D space survival shooter</strong> where every second counts. Battle through relentless 20-second waves of enemies, each more intense than the last, as you fight for survival in deep space.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Between waves, tactically spend points earned from defeated enemies to upgrade your ship — enhance your <strong>attack power, defense systems, core capabilities</strong>, and experiment with different <strong>ammo types</strong> to match your playstyle and counter enemy behavior.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Featuring <strong>strategic progression</strong>, <strong>diverse enemy types</strong>, and <strong>responsive combat</strong>, <i>Project MT</i> challenges you to stay sharp and think ahead. Climb the <strong>global leaderboard</strong>, master your ship's loadout, and see how long you can survive the chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Key Features:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-player 2D space survival shooter</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >20-second enemy waves with upgrade phases between</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic upgrade system: attack, defense, systems, and ammo types</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced action combined with strategic decision-making</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple enemy types with unique behaviors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full keyboard and gamepad support</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Global leaderboard to track and compete with top survivors</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Co-op local multiplayer</p></li></ul>",
